# N10: the start map's entrance hall, slop, no status bar, a slow linear dolly. The edit
# dims it under its diagram.
#
# Under V3-48: "Claude, Anthropic's model, wrote the code, as fleets of agents, each on
# its own branch with a written brief." (S57), and V3-49, "A chair merged a branch only
# when every check passed." (S58).

map start

duration 13.6
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset slop
hud off
cvar gamma 0.8

camera path
key 0     544,272.31,54  0,90  ease linear
key 13.6  544,485.69,54  0,90

sound on
events on
